loading_tips = PackedStringArray("Space Cadets crouch before they pounce. Sidestep while they are crouched and they land on nothing.", "A sputtering jetpack means a mechanic is about to fly over. Climbing the launch deck will not shake it off.", "Hazmat workers burst into a radioactive cloud when they drop. Get out of the green ring before it pops.", "The launch deck is a third route between the lanes: ramps on the south-east and north-west corners.", "Between waves, the supply pod in the plaza sells energy and snacks. Follow the beacon.")
